  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Ampliacin del Tramo de Cuatro Carriles de la Carretera East Bank Demerara</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East Bank Demerara Four Lane Extension</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo principal del proyecto es mejorar la movilidad y la seguridad urbanas ysuburbanas, reduciendo los costos de transporte y las tasas de accidente mediante la ampliacin de la carretera principal de East Bank Demerara al sur de Providence, de dos a cuatro carriles.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to enhance urban and suburban mobility and safety, through lowered transport costs and reduced accident rates by expanding the East Bank Demerara Main Road south of Providence from two lanes to four lanes.</narrative>
  </description>
